# The macOS agent, bitwig-jvmti-tracer.dylib, as build-agent-mac.sh (beside this file) builds it
# on a Mac. Build outputs never go into git (standard 12), so this records the build instead:
# the pinned toolchain (standard 11), the SHA-256 of every input and of the result. loader/build.py
# takes a Mac-built dylib into a release only while these inputs are the source's and the file's
# SHA-256 is dylib; after a change to an input, the agent is rebuilt on a Mac and this file updated
# from the build's BML_MAC_AGENT line.
clt=26.6.0.0.1781586589
clang=Apple clang version 21.0.0 (clang-2100.1.1.101)
sdk=26.5
target=12.0
